                <content>
                  <p>Insert:</p>
                </content>
                <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                  <content>
                    <p><b><i>Multilateral </i></b><b><i>Convention </i></b>means the <i>Multilateral Convention to Implement Tax Treaty Related Measures to Prevent Base Erosion and Profit Shifting</i> done at Paris on 7 June 2017.</p>
                  </content>
                  <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-2" marker="2">
                    <content>
                      <p>Note:	In 2018, the text of this convention was accessible through the Australian Treaties Library on the AustLII website (www.austlii.edu.au).</p>
                    </content>
                  </authorialNote>
                </quotedStructure>
